      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">An eleventh aspect of the present disclosure</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is that, in any one of the first to tenth aspects, the content of the monomer is 1% to 20% by weight of the copolymer.</span>
