      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a twelfth aspect of the present disclosure</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is that, in any one of the first to eleventh aspects, the acrylic polymer constituting the hybrid polymer particles and the acrylic polymer constituting the acrylic polymer particles each independently include an alkyl methacrylate repeating unit having an alkyl group having 1 to 18 carbon atoms.</span>
