      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the porous organic/inorganic composite coating layer 3</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">has the heterogeneity in composition morphology in a thickness direction, in which the content ratio of hybrid polymer particles 5 /acrylic polymer particles 7 present on a surface portion opposite to the surface in contact with the polymer substrate 1 is greater than the content ratio of hybrid polymer particles 5 /acrylic polymer particles 7 present inside the porous organic/inorganic composite coating layer.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0051">
