        <span itemprop="subject">the porous polymer substrate 1</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is capable of providing a movement path of lithium ions while preventing a short circuit by electrically insulating the negative electrode and the positive electrode and may be used without particular limitation as long as it is generally used as a separator polymer substrate of an electrochemical device.</span>
